                    {
                        "sense_id": "21a781f6-5b8e-3ab6-8c22-89271606b1db",
                        "entry_id": "cdc93404-f86e-349c-afcd-1eae16e4a944",
                        "glosses": [
                            "осуществляясь своими силами, без посторонней помощи или чьего-либо руководства"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "42b61c33-7bee-4f1c-a7de-e8f5804f9798",
                                "sense_id": "21a781f6-5b8e-3ab6-8c22-89271606b1db",
                                "text": "В отличие от барбитуратов и бензодиазепина, этот препарат можно купить без рецепта и использовать самостоятельно."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "30c48f16-574d-318e-8f1a-6a0d5bb57943",
                        "entry_id": "cdc93404-f86e-349c-afcd-1eae16e4a944",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. будучи оригинальным, свободным от посторонних влияний"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e8650c4f-838a-499f-a30c-7911ae6add57",
                        "source_entry_id": "cdc93404-f86e-349c-afcd-1eae16e4a944",
                        "target_lang_word": "independently",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "independently",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d543293-1df3-358d-8b7a-cccf4f9de941",
                                        "entry_id": "b168123c-afa3-3b45-b38a-9c5ac781d330",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an independent manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71c2deb6-d923-4091-9f69-d65590c1bf1b",
                                                "sense_id": "9d543293-1df3-358d-8b7a-cccf4f9de941",
                                                "text": "Both teams worked out the answers independently."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21b4e437-f08d-4332-a827-b25d1b8f5ea0",
                                                "sense_id": "9d543293-1df3-358d-8b7a-cccf4f9de941",
                                                "text": "The business partners had radically different ideas for the company, and each decided to work on a project independently of the other."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df56b485-bf1a-4c7e-b8b8-463f305a34c5",
                                                "sense_id": "9d543293-1df3-358d-8b7a-cccf4f9de941",
                                                "text": "The most likely conclusion, the researchers say, is that the Levallois method was not taken to Eurasia by African migrants, but evolved there gradually and independently."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a3888942-9b97-4996-8a4c-e43b66d99338",
                        "source_entry_id": "cdc93404-f86e-349c-afcd-1eae16e4a944",
                        "target_lang_word": "by himself",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7cbb31d2-493a-4752-bef5-546552768a02",
                        "source_entry_id": "cdc93404-f86e-349c-afcd-1eae16e4a944",
                        "target_lang_word": "singly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "singly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd4234c2-8ed5-36d9-ad1f-249f3de7626f",
                                        "entry_id": "4d26d7c0-1034-317d-9e8b-53a451d33f3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a single or unaccompanied manner; without a companion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89e71018-2c16-4079-8dc3-6d69a83e3ec9",
                                                "sense_id": "cd4234c2-8ed5-36d9-ad1f-249f3de7626f",
                                                "text": "Singly, they are every one a representation or appearance of some quality, or other accident of a body without us, which is commonly called an object."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4614a302-d6a4-466f-a8a4-092b2b1ddb4f",
                                                "sense_id": "cd4234c2-8ed5-36d9-ad1f-249f3de7626f",
                                                "text": "The cross, reared now above all other objects, and standing singly out against the sky, was greeted with a burst of delight; […"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0322befd-a36d-413e-8d55-416f35ce6395",
                                                "sense_id": "cd4234c2-8ed5-36d9-ad1f-249f3de7626f",
                                                "text": "Grey-coloured woods covered a large part of the surface. This even tint was indeed broken up by streaks of yellow sand-break in the lower lands, and by many tall trees of the pine family, out-topping the others—some singly, some in clumps […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41e667b9-1bb2-4ac8-a5aa-d2254fe716ec",
                                                "sense_id": "cd4234c2-8ed5-36d9-ad1f-249f3de7626f",
                                                "text": "They dragged themselves from the swamp singly, and in twos and threes, more dead than alive, mere perambulating skeletons, until at last there were thirty of us."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d8be486-e305-3b69-adf3-4a3233dc5da1",
                                        "entry_id": "4d26d7c0-1034-317d-9e8b-53a451d33f3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Individually; particularly; severally."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b633800b-c582-4544-a634-efd0db8c3e14",
                                                "sense_id": "5d8be486-e305-3b69-adf3-4a3233dc5da1",
                                                "text": "to make men singly and personally good"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cdf862c9-d812-4f9f-87f2-a04e1463e019",
                                                "sense_id": "5d8be486-e305-3b69-adf3-4a3233dc5da1",
                                                "text": "Ursula saw that now Bella Watson's chance meetings with him had to be strategically and singly planned by Bella, whose wifely attentions to the bereaved man were markedly meaning."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "14e900bf-bba9-30fe-9cfd-0aa812f8fbad",
                                        "entry_id": "4d26d7c0-1034-317d-9e8b-53a451d33f3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without partners, companions, or associates; single-handed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20a36680-4f4e-4e47-af6b-62c41353494f",
                                                "sense_id": "14e900bf-bba9-30fe-9cfd-0aa812f8fbad",
                                                "text": "to attack another singly"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b418f27b-eac1-3baa-b224-e17a5668b354",
                                        "entry_id": "4d26d7c0-1034-317d-9e8b-53a451d33f3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Honestly; sincerely; simply."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e64c066-e8eb-3f18-9803-71f5f15b09f3",
                                        "entry_id": "4d26d7c0-1034-317d-9e8b-53a451d33f3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Singularly; peculiarly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "04445e4b-fa91-4347-a409-c305bce0b4d6",
                        "source_entry_id": "cdc93404-f86e-349c-afcd-1eae16e4a944",
                        "target_lang_word": "on one's own",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "on one's own",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09c25358-7736-3a18-83d7-50d3cb2e1dd0",
                                        "entry_id": "5e83ce94-5221-33e4-8da1-0370eeed0adf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unaided; without assistance or help from others."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87c9b30b-28ae-4267-88b3-2a7263537db9",
                                                "sense_id": "09c25358-7736-3a18-83d7-50d3cb2e1dd0",
                                                "text": "Private operators, for the most part have done an admirable job of keeping these aging aircraft flying, but FAA has essentially said, “It’s public-use aircraft. You’re on your own.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca10ba25-28ae-42c4-aade-13c51eae9ebf",
                                                "sense_id": "09c25358-7736-3a18-83d7-50d3cb2e1dd0",
                                                "text": "They may adamantly reject help and insist that they can manage on their own."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e8198ec-caeb-4fe1-abe9-da211e37a253",
                                                "sense_id": "09c25358-7736-3a18-83d7-50d3cb2e1dd0",
                                                "text": "A seven-year-old can get dressed on his own, but it might take a long time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65571d1a-9328-4df7-a868-75f8aa1f3782",
                                                "sense_id": "09c25358-7736-3a18-83d7-50d3cb2e1dd0",
                                                "text": "1966, Vicki Wickham, Simon Napier-Bell (English lyrics), Dusty Springfield (vocalist), You Don't Have to Say You Love Me, 1965, Pino Donaggio, Vito Pallavicini, Io che non vivo (senza te),\nDon't you see / That now you've gone, / And I'm left here on my own, / I will have to follow you / And beg you to come home."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "649d1424-a15d-4b3f-876f-0fe542d9d5b5",
                                                "sense_id": "09c25358-7736-3a18-83d7-50d3cb2e1dd0",
                                                "text": "After Bridge of Orchy, the line climbs steeply into the wild country of Rannoch Moor. The railway builders chose a different route across the moor from the road - we are completely on our own up here."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9bd5a4c8-a445-368b-b971-9cfb17c07bdd",
                                        "entry_id": "5e83ce94-5221-33e4-8da1-0370eeed0adf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alone, without another's immediate company."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c3554b0-0558-4a42-b3bd-c8f732060d35",
                                                "sense_id": "9bd5a4c8-a445-368b-b971-9cfb17c07bdd",
                                                "text": "I love cheese on toast, but I won't eat cheese on its own."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "56655c89-1786-4599-b43f-163f1bffe164",
